Well, my pickup_types doesn't allow scimitars, of course. I use
autopickup_exception to rule out certain tools, and rule in certain
weapons, armor, and food.  For instance, right now my defaults.nh
includes what's below.  Some of the lines are commented out in the early
game, when I'm still looking for keys, blindfolds, and pick-axes.

It's not so much saving the extra turn, as it is knowing that I won't 
miss some polypilable or otherwise valuable object.

# TOOLS
autopickup_exception=">*key"
autopickup_exception=">*lock pick"
autopickup_exception=">*credit card"

autopickup_exception=">*pick-axe"
autopickup_exception=">*blindfold"
